<title>FRANCE: EU cuts refund on durum wheat semolina exports.</title>
<headline>EU cuts refund on durum wheat semolina exports.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday cut the daily refund on exports of durum wheat semolina to eight Ecus per tonnne from a previous level of 10 Ecus, France's grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>The move is designed to deter processed product exports between Christmas and the New Year. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
